  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0 - Transactional Outbox primitives: OutboxRow, IOutboxWriter, IOutboxSignal, OutboxSignal, IDbConnectionFactory, OutboxOptions, OutboxDispatcher (BackgroundService), IRawMessagePublisher, PublishRawAsync on IReliableMessagePublisher<T>, CreateRawPublisher on IPublisherFactory, and AddOutboxDispatcher DI extension. Enables at-least-once atomic outbox dispatch for PaymentsService, PaymentsRouter, and PaymentsIntegration (CH-B).",
